a Caroline, la Floride, & les Isles Bahama: contenant les desseins des oiseaux, animaux, poissons, serpents, insectes, & plantes. Et en particulier, des arbres des forets, arbrisseaux, & autres plantes, qui n'ont point été decrits, jusques à present par les auteurs, ou peu exactement dessinés. Avec leur descriptions en françois & en anglois. A quoi on a adjouté, des observations sur l'air, le sol, & les eaux, avec des remarques sur l'agriculture, les grains, les legumes, les racines, &c. Le tout est precedé d'une carte nouvelle & exacte des païs dont il s'agist.","Artist":"Mark Catesby","Date":"","Medium":"","CreditLine":"Wellcome Collection (Public Domain Mark)","URL":"https://wellcomecollection.org/works/qzmyqb6d/images?id=a4bh2jtj","ImageURL":"https://iiif.wellcomecollection.org/image/L0055248/full/!1000,1000/0/default.jpg","ObjectID":6540},{"Title":"Claude-Ambroise Seurat, Daniel Lambert, Jeffery Hudson and an unidentified giant, surrounded by eight vignettes of other characters. Stipple engraving.","Artist":"","Date":"","Medium":"","CreditLine":"Wellcome Collection (Public Domain Mark)","URL":"https://wellcomecollection.org/works/r7qaq87z/images?id=bfg5r7nt","ImageURL":"https://iiif.wellcomecollection.org/image/V0007447/full/!1000,1000/0/default.jpg","ObjectID":6651},{"Title":"Buxton, Derbyshire: the baths, with scale key. Wood engraving by B. Sly after H. Currey.","Artist":"Currey, Henry, 1820-1900; Sly, Benjamin, active 1841-1883.","Date":"","Medium":"","CreditLine":"Wellcome Collection (Public Domain Mark)","URL":"https://wellcomecollection.org/works/rfduxb6p/images?id=axyrsdve","ImageURL":"https://iiif.wellcomecollection.org/image/V0012295/full/!1000,1000/0/default.jpg","ObjectID":6762},{"Title":"Florence Sarah Craven, Mrs Dacre Craven, née Lees. Photograph.","Artist":"","Date":"","Medium":"","CreditLine":"Wellcome Collection (Public Domain Mark)","URL":"https://wellcomecollection.org/works/rrjarzvt/images?id=bjwz9ztr","ImageURL":"https://iiif.wellcomecolle